 <div class="title-header">
        <h5>Frequently Asked Questions</h5>
        <h2 class="title">Get Your Answer Here</h2></div><div class="title-desc">Below you’ll find answers to some of the most frequently asked question. We are constantly adding most asked question to this page.</div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-3"></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="widget widget-search"></div><p class="text-center">If you have any other questions <a href="mailto:yourbitemydiet@gmail.com"class="ttm-textcolor-skincolor">yourbitemydiet@gmail.com</a></p></div><div class="col-md-3"></div></div></div></section><div class="clearfix ttm-row faqs-accordion-section"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="mb-20 accordion"><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border active"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseOne"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">Does weight loss diet will weaken my immunity?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>This is only a myth. An unhealthy diet and excess body fat weaken your immune system. Even modest weight loss reverses many of the damaging changes often seen in the immune cells of obese individuals. Whichever diet you choose, our goal is to balance your system. We provide you variety of fruits, vegetables, legumes, nuts, and seeds in your plan which are very essential for strengthening your immune system. Following a crash diet or fad diet to lose weight quickly is extremely harmful and may weaken your immune system. These diets are deficient in essential nutrients, especially proteins, vitamins, and minerals, needed for the efficient response of our immune system. So it is always recommended to follow a diet under the guidance of a certified Dietician.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseTwo"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">How can I follow a diet if I don’t have time to prepare separate meals for myself?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>You don’t have to prepare separate meals for yourself. You just need to choose the right food for you that may help to achieve your target. At Bite And Diet we talk to you first and then prepare the meal plan depending on your needs, food availability, food habits & taste. We will also provide you with handy tips that will help you to follow your plan easily.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">Can I lose weight if I have Hypothyroid?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>Losing weight is never easy, but if your Hypothyroidism is under-control you can lose weight.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">How much weight can I lose in one month?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>Weight loss depends on several factors like your age, metabolism, health conditions, etc. But in general, you can lose around 3-4 kg in a month.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">What supplements should i take?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>You don’t need to spend countless hours trying to research which supplements are right for you. It will depend on your age and health condition. So it is always recommended to take supplements under the guidance of a certified Dietician. At Bite And Diet we will guide you regarding the supplements if needed.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">How do I stick to my meal plan when I hang out with friends?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>However, we provide you with special meal planning for occasions like work travel, holiday, wedding, festivals, etc. Eating out with friends—is challenging if unplanned. But at Bite and Diet we will help you to filter healthy foods from a menu and explore healthier cocktail options. We will also help you to lose excess weight quickly that you may have gained after the treatment.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">What if I gain weight once my plan is over?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>You can’t be on a strict diet for a lifetime. That is why we don’t leave you like this. Our premier packages include a maintenance plan at the end of the program. You won’t gain weight if you follow the maintenance plan. We maintain a lifelong relationship with you and provide support anytime you need it.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">Should I track my calories? How many calories should I eat daily?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>There’s no one-size-fits-all answer to this question. At Bite And Diet we will guide you regarding your calorie requirement. We will also let you know after initial consultation if counting calories will be a helpful strategy for your specific goals or not.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">Are there certain ages at which a body’s metabolism slows down?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>Study published in August 2021 in Science suggests that differences in metabolism is based on four distinct periods of life:<br>From infancy to 1 year old, metabolic rate surged until it was about 50 percent higher than it will be during adulthood.<br>From 1 to 20 years old, metabolism decreased by almost 3 percent a year.<br>From 20 to 60, metabolism didn't change.<br>After age 60, metabolism decreased by 0.7 percent annually <a href="https://www.everydayhealth.com/diet-nutrition/metabolism-may-not-decline-with-age-as-
previously-thought/"class="ttm-textcolor-skincolor">Link</a></p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">Is it beneficial for a person with arthritis to seek the help of a doctor or nutritionist?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>The treatment is different for different kinds of arthritis. So a physician can help you to find which type of arthritis you have. Whereas a Dietician can help you to know which food to include in your diet decrease inflammation and which food you should try to avoid.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">I am a foody person, Can you make a meal plan for me to follow?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>I never ask people to give up their favorite foods unless they are not allergic to them. Nor do I want you to eat foods you don’t like. There are plenty of healthy foods in the world that everyone can enjoy for a healthy lifestyle.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">How is a dietician different from nutritionists?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>A dietician has had 5 years of accredited university training specifically around nutrition science. We use food more than we would ever use supplements. Our recommendations are science-based rather than the latest trends in dieting and eating.<br>A dietician can also call themselves a nutritionist however a nutritionist cannot call themselves a dietician.</p></div></div><div class="toggle ttm-style-classic ttm-toggle-title-border"><div class="toggle-title"><a href="#collapseThree"data-parent="#accordion"data-toggle="collapse">Who can see a dietician?</a></div><div class="toggle-content"><p>Anyone can see a dietician if they want to improve their health and medical condition in a natural way.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="clearfix ttm-row faqs-cta-section ttm-bgcolor-skincolor"><div class="container  my-5 pt-20"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-8"><div class="ttm-textcolor-white row-title style6 text-right"><h2 class="title pb-10">Have you any question for work consultation</h2></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="row-title style6 text-left"><a href="https://wa.me/+918826549878"class="mb-20 ttm-btn ttm-btn-color-white ttm-btn-shape-round ttm-btn-size-md ttm-btn-style-border">Contact Me</a></div></div></div></div></section></div>

